    {'para': '**188. Verbs, ⟨a⟩-conjugation. Imperfect Middle.** The imperfect middle of verbs in ⟨a⟩ is as follows:'},
    {'table': {'head': ['', 'Sing.', 'Dual.', 'Plural.'], 'rows': [['1.', '⟨alabhe⟩ (a + i)', '⟨alabhāvahi⟩', '⟨alabhāmahi⟩'], ['2.', '⟨alabhathās⟩', '⟨alabhethām⟩', '⟨alabhadhvam⟩'], ['3.', '⟨alabhata⟩', '⟨alabhetām⟩', '⟨alabhanta⟩']]}},
